DESCRIPTION:<b>AOS</b>: 08:15:14 UTC <br>RX: <b>145.800 MHz</b> - FM over E
 urope<br>webstream: <a href="https://live.ariss.org/hamtv/" target="_blank"
 >https://live.ariss.org/hamtv/</a><br><br>The HamTV unit is scheduled to se
 nd "tone and bars" during the 08:15 UTC pass as a Pre-Contact test. This te
 st is the first attempt to use the recently reinstalled HamTV transmitter d
 uring a ARISS contact.<br>HamTV DATV frequency is 2395 MHz.<br><br>Live vid
 eo from the ISS will be attempted during the 09:51 UTC pass.
