DESCRIPTION:You may be aware of the MarconISSta project that has been runni
 ng on the ARISS station in the Columbus module of the ISS – https://marconi
 ssta.com\n\nThe project team have been informed that the experiment is due 
 to be decommissioned on Feb 9th and Martin Buscher DJ1MBB\, the lead for Ma
 rconISSta\, has requested some support to help categorise the antennas on t
 he ISS.  \n\nIf you have UHF tx capability and can track the ISS\, please h
 ave a look at https://marconissta.com/2019/02/05/urgent-call-all-power-to-t
 he-iss/ and help if you can.
